{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>oGANTTo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a deck-building game in which players plan, adapt, and optimize their supply chains to achieve internal goals such as budget and score objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/76024ff01926d54ca9bf42f493166763.poster.avif?t=1767792237\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/76024ff01926d54ca9bf42f493166763.webm?t=1767792237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/76024ff01926d54ca9bf42f493166763.mp4?t=1767792237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Strategic Planning &amp; Analysis</u></i></strong><br>As a manager, you look closely at your supply chain. You think about the resources available to you. Then, you choose the techniques that will get you the best results. Every plan you make affects how information, materials, and costs move. Plan well to be successful or you risk falling behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/b621f6cc8f6bdda05fbd0f1c7c22c24d.poster.avif?t=1767792237\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/b621f6cc8f6bdda05fbd0f1c7c22c24d.webm?t=1767792237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/b621f6cc8f6bdda05fbd0f1c7c22c24d.mp4?t=1767792237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Resource Management</u></i></strong> <br>Your workforce is your greatest asset. Deploy specialists and general labor strategically to boost productivity. Assign the right people to the right tasks to drive progress, but <strong>beware</strong>: <i>inefficient</i> use of employees can derail even the best-laid plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/7f08939fef46388ace8ab0f96d166545.poster.avif?t=1767792237\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/7f08939fef46388ace8ab0f96d166545.webm?t=1767792237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/7f08939fef46388ace8ab0f96d166545.mp4?t=1767792237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Master Economic Techniques</u></i></strong><br>Unlock and apply  economic strategies to gain the edge. Schedule overtime, add extra shifts, hit critical milestones, or conduct customer visits to accelerate your progress. Each technique brings unique benefits and challenges\u2014choose wisely to optimize your outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/2748b5123db36a09b1a62bba75bd173a.poster.avif?t=1767792237\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/2748b5123db36a09b1a62bba75bd173a.webm?t=1767792237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/extras/2748b5123db36a09b1a62bba75bd173a.mp4?t=1767792237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Leadership Styles &amp; Campaign Progression</u></i></strong><br>Lead your team with distinct management philosophies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management by Results: Focus on outcomes and drive your team to meet ambitious targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management by Objective: Set clear goals and align your workforce to achieve them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management by Motivation: Inspire your employees to unlock their full potential.<br>Explore additional leadership approaches as you tackle increasingly complex campaigns. From small projects to large businesses, each campaign makes things more difficult and offers many ways to win.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Dynamic Deck-Building</u></i></strong><br>Build and improve your deck to show how you like to manage things. Join together resources, techniques, and leadership tactics to create a positive effect that makes your project successful. Try different strategies to find the right mix of risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>A Game in Active Development</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My realtime job is planning of Projects. Therefor I made this game, to combine my labor to gaming, developing and working.<br>If you like to check out my passion, feel free.\u00a0<br>It is a challanging game for your brain, numbers are rolled and you have to desside the direction. Enjoy the journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Velemir, Developer</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617270?t=1767792237","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617270/f350fcde705c0e8e2415336a237015f214457f33/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767792237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite